; Installer texts (ADR 45, invariant 6): Inno's own translation mechanism, one line per language.
; Every key must exist for every language; scripts/build-installer.mjs fails the build otherwise.

[CustomMessages]
spanish.DesktopIcon=Crear un acceso directo en el escritorio
spanish.LaunchApp=Abrir Ludiary
spanish.AskRemoveData=¿Quieres borrar también tus datos de Ludiary (biblioteca, ajustes, registros y la clave guardada en el Administrador de credenciales)?%n%nSi eliges No, se conservan por si vuelves a instalar Ludiary.
spanish.StopFailed=No se ha podido cerrar Ludiary, que sigue en marcha. Ciérralo desde el icono de la bandeja (Salir) y vuelve a intentarlo.
english.DesktopIcon=Create a desktop shortcut
english.LaunchApp=Open Ludiary
english.StopFailed=Ludiary could not be closed and is still running. Close it from the tray icon (Quit) and try again.
english.AskRemoveData=Do you also want to delete your Ludiary data (library, settings, logs and the key stored in Credential Manager)?%n%nIf you choose No, they are kept in case you reinstall Ludiary.

